  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SALAR Ukraine - PROSTO Project support to administrative services 2021-2024 - New SALAR Ukraine - support to administrative services 2021-2023</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SKR Ukraina - PROSTO Project st&#xf6;d till administrativ service 2021-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till att st&#xf6;dja f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttringen av administrativa servicecentra i Ukraina i linje med den p&#xe5;g&#xe5;ende decentraliseringsreformen. Projektet kommer att tillhandah&#xe5;lla experthj&#xe4;lp och kapacitetsuppbyggnadshj&#xe4;lp till de ukrainska samh&#xe4;llena f&#xf6;r att etablera och driva centra f&#xf6;r offentliga tj&#xe4;nster.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&apos;s aims to support the improvement of administrative services centers in Ukraine in line with the ongoing decentralization reform. The project will provide in hand expert and capacity building assistance to the Ukrainian communities to establish and run the centers of public services.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution aims at improving the local service delivery for citizens of Ukraine by providing advisory and technical support to establish administrative service centers. 

In addition to that, the project will also work on the national level with key decision makers to shape / improve the national legislation in the area of administrative service provision.</narrative>
  </description>
